    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590920/extras/092123f658ce66483cc3680d8e183081.avif?t=1682530183\" /></div><br><br>THIS GAME IS FOCUSED ON PUZZLES, INSPIRED BY NOTPRON.<br><br>Where does it come from? <br>If so, do you have one?<br>Its History ?<br>Here it begins.....<br><br>In The Wave Story you will go through the most diverse enigmas, using audios, pictures, ciphers and more.<br>The challenge is continuous and is made more difficult with each part, can you finish your story? or will fall into limbo again?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590920/extras/1efcf3cd5b61ded9fb90b4b9986b1985.avif?t=1682530183\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590920/extras/092123f658ce66483cc3680d8e183081.avif?t=1682530183\" /></div><br><br>The game is based on solving puzzles based on proposed hints,<br>the difficulty is gradual and intense.<br><br>The game contains a total of 10 puzzles, with many others hidden.<br>Can you find them?<br>Can you solve all the puzzles?<br>If so, your story has just begun.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590920/extras/1efcf3cd5b61ded9fb90b4b9986b1985.avif?t=1682530183\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590920/extras/092123f658ce66483cc3680d8e183081.avif?t=1682530183\" /></div><br><br>THIS GAME IS FOCUSED ON PUZZLES, INSPIRED BY NOTPRON.<br><br>Where does it come from? <br>If so, do you have one?<br>Its History ?<br>Here it begins.....<br><br>In The Wave Story you will go through the most diverse enigmas, using audios, pictures, ciphers and more.<br>The challenge is continuous and is made more difficult with each part, can you finish your story? or will fall into limbo again?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590920/extras/1efcf3cd5b61ded9fb90b4b9986b1985.avif?t=1682530183\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590920/extras/092123f658ce66483cc3680d8e183081.avif?t=1682530183\" /></div><br><br>The game is based on solving puzzles based on proposed hints,<br>the difficulty is gradual and intense.<br><br>The game contains a total of 10 puzzles, with many others hidden.<br>Can you find them?<br>Can you solve all the puzzles?<br>If so, your story has just begun.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590920/extras/1efcf3cd5b61ded9fb90b4b9986b1985.avif?t=1682530183\" /></div>",
